### 1. GET All books
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/books
Authorization: Basic admin:admin
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. GET one book
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/books/2
Authorization: Basic admin:admin
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. CREATE one book
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/books
Authorization: Basic admin:admin
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Zero Trust Networks",
  "author": "Evan Gilman, Doug Barth",
  "description": "Building Secure Systems in Untrusted Networks",
  "price": 45.00,
  "published_year": 2017
}

###

### 4. Update one book
PUT http://localhost:8000/api/v1/books/1
Authorization: Basic admin:admin
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Web Application Security (Updated)",
  "description": "Updated description with audit metadata",
  "price": 34.99
}

###

### 5. DELETE one book
DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/v1/books/1
Authorization: Basic admin:admin
Accept: application/json

###
